  "summary": "Expired relationships included in permission checks in github.com/authzed/spicedb",
  "details": "ConcurrentChecker.checkDirect miscounts direct subjects without expiration when a relation unions a subject type using expiration with a non-terminal relation on the same subject type. Permission checks over that relation skip datastore expiration filtering and can include expired relationships until they are garbage collected.",
